{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55288","headline":"贺李昉除翰林学士（题拟） · 范质","name":"贺李昉除翰林学士（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翰苑重求李谪仙，词锋颖利胜龙泉。\n朝趋建礼霞烘日，夜直承明月映天。\n圣主重知缘国士。\n相公多喜爲同年。\n青春才子金门贵。\n蜀锦袍新夺日鲜。\n（周本淳校点本《诗话总龟》卷二七引《古今诗话》。\n此诗爲周世宗征淮南间作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范质","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}